 #                          a bin/fm-inbox.sh note is queued and has not been
 #                          surfaced yet; reported once per note, never again
 #                          while that record stays queued
+#   check: crew board fm #<seq> from <task> - <message>
+#                          a message on the crew board's fm topic, queued by
+#                          bin/fm-board-bridge.sh and reported once, like an
+#                          inbox note; the board is a hint, never the ledger
 #   check: process-event result captured: <keys>
